# CLI --output result dumps left in the project root (e.g. from
# `python src/eme_calculator.py --output results.json`). Anchored to the
# root only (leading slash, no wildcard directories) so it does NOT
# affect tracked JSON that belongs in the repo, like
# data/site_profiles/*.json or data/sky_noise/*.json.
/*.json
